From: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 02:35:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: airoha: pair NPU memory layouts

The independent memory-region and memory-region-names alternatives allow
their item counts to be mixed. Pair the supported one-, two-, four- and
six-item layouts so malformed device trees fail schema validation.

Signed-off-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
 .../bindings/net/airoha,en7581-npu.yaml       | 30 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 30 insertions(+)

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/airoha,en7581-npu.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/airoha,en7581-npu.yaml
@@ -110,6 +110,36 @@ properties:
           - const: ba
           - const: mbox
 
+oneOf:
+  - properties:
+      memory-region:
+        minItems: 1
+        maxItems: 1
+      memory-region-names:
+        minItems: 1
+        maxItems: 1
+  - properties:
+      memory-region:
+        minItems: 2
+        maxItems: 2
+      memory-region-names:
+        minItems: 2
+        maxItems: 2
+  - properties:
+      memory-region:
+        minItems: 4
+        maxItems: 4
+      memory-region-names:
+        minItems: 4
+        maxItems: 4
+  - properties:
+      memory-region:
+        minItems: 6
+        maxItems: 6
+      memory-region-names:
+        minItems: 6
+        maxItems: 6
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg

